				"00B3222F85844A67"
				"7B5C06E2EFBDDAFC"
			]
			description: [
				"&7Congratulations, engineer. By completing the &6Forge Rocket&r, you have reached the final milestone of &6Create - Forge Frontier&r.&r"
				""
				"What began as a small workshop has grown into a sprawling industrial empire capable of spanning worlds. Through determination, ingenuity, and countless hours of automation, you have conquered every major challenge the pack has placed before you."
				""
				"Very few will ever reach this point."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lA Monument to Mastery&r"
				""
				"The Forge Rocket is more than a machine—it is a symbol of everything you have accomplished."
				""
				"You have explored distant planets, defeated legendary foes, mastered advanced production chains, and built the infrastructure required to support interplanetary industry."
				""
				"Every factory, every machine, and every resource gathered has contributed to this achievement."
				""
				"This rocket stands as proof of your mastery."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lYour Journey Continues&r"
				""
				"As a reward for completing this monumental challenge, you have earned a &6Celestial Trophy&r—a rare artifact commemorating your accomplishment."
				""
				"Display it proudly as a reminder of the worlds you explored, the challenges you overcame, and the legacy you forged among the stars."
				""
				"Few engineers possess the skill, patience, and determination required to earn such a reward."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Though your adventure may be complete, the factory you built and the empire you created will stand as a testament to your achievement for years to come."
				""
				"The stars have been conquered."
				""
				"The machines stand silent."
				""
				"And your legacy has been forged forever."
			]
