			description: [
				"&7The Arcane Calibration Matrix is crafted using a collection of powerful enchanting-related items, advanced magical components, and specialized blocks obtained during the late stages of progression.&r"
				""
				"This component serves as a celebration of the magical and enchanting systems encountered throughout your journey, bringing together some of the most powerful arcane technologies available."
				""
