				"Before beginning construction, ensure you have acquired:"
				""
				"- Advanced enchanting infrastructure"
				"- High-tier enchanted artifacts"
				"- Late-game magical blocks"
				"- Rare experience-based components"
				"- Powerful arcane materials"
				""
				"Every ingredient contributes a fragment of magical knowledge, creating a matrix capable of guiding the Forge Rocket through the final stages of its construction."
				""
				"Review the recipe carefully and gather the required artifacts before beginning assembly."
			]
