		{
			description: [
				"&7Rocket Fin&r is a required component used in the construction of the &6Forge Rocket Fin&r."
				""
				"&lHow to Obtain:&r"
				"Rocket Fins are crafted using &7Steel Plates&r. These aerodynamic components provide stability and control during launch, making them an essential part of any spacecraft design."
				""
