		{
			description: [
				"&7Witherite Ingot&r is a required component used in the construction of the &6Forge Rocket Fin&r."
				""
				"&lHow to Obtain:&r"
				"Witherite Ingots are crafted using &8Witherite&r, a rare material dropped exclusively by &cThe Harbinger&r."
				""
				"The Harbinger resides within the &7Ancient Factory&r on the &fMoon&r, where he commands an army of corrupted machines and guards some of the most valuable resources found throughout lunar progression."
				""
				"After defeating The Harbinger, collect the Witherite he drops and refine it into Witherite Ingots for use in advanced crafting recipes."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&lNotes:&r"
				"Witherite is one of the key materials obtained through Moon boss progression and serves as an important ingredient in several late-game components."
				""
				"Need help locating the Ancient Factory and defeating The Harbinger?"
				""
				"{ \"text\": \"Ancient Factory\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"blue\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"6A6CBE62C6E115C6\" } }"
