		{
			description: [
				"&7Primal Magma Casing&r is a required component used in the construction of the &6Forge Rocket Fin&r."
				""
				"&lHow to Obtain:&r"
				"The Primal Magma Casing is the final evolution of the rocket casing progression chain, representing the culmination of every spacecraft constructed throughout your journey."
				""
				"To craft it, you must progress through the entire series of rocket casings, upgrading each tier until you reach the Primal Magma variant. This process incorporates materials and technologies gathered from multiple planets, dimensions, and stages of progression."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&lNotes:&r"
				"A key ingredient in the Primal Magma Casing is &6Primal Magma&r, a rare material obtained from the &6Primordial Caves&r of Alex's Caves."
				""
				"The Primal Magma Casing serves as a testament to your mastery of rocket engineering, combining knowledge gained from every previous spacecraft into a single advanced component."
				""
				"Need help reaching the Primordial Caves and obtaining Primal Magma?"
				""
				"{ \"text\": \"Primordial Caves\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"blue\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"1FE777D1CAD0CE01\" } }"
			]
