			x: 5.5d
			y: 14.5d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"&7Essence of the Storm&r is a required component used in the construction of the &6Forge Rocket Fin&r."
				""
				"&lHow to Obtain:&r"
				"Essence of the Storm is obtained by defeating &3Scylla&r, the powerful Cataclysm boss that resides atop the floating city of &bAcropolis&r."
				""
				"Unlike many progression structures found on distant planets, Acropolis can be discovered within the &aOverworld&r, floating high above the oceans. After overcoming the creatures that guard the city and defeating Scylla, you can claim the Essence of the Storm—a fragment of her immense power and one of the key materials required for advanced rocket construction."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&lNotes:&r"
				"Obtaining this item requires conquering one of the most challenging Overworld encounters."
				""
				"Need help locating Acropolis and defeating Scylla?"
				""
				"{ \"text\": \"Acropolis\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"blue\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"5F05530DA01EEECA\" } }"
