				""
				"&lHow to Obtain:&r"
				"Rocket Engines are crafted through an advanced &6Sequenced Assembly&r process, combining Engine Pistons, Engine Turbochargers, Precision Mechanisms, Infernal Mechanisms, Sealed Mechanisms, and a Blaze Cake."
				""
				"Each assembly step further enhances the engine, transforming basic mechanical components into a propulsion system capable of powering spacecraft across the stars."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&lNotes:&r"
				"The Rocket Engine serves as a core component throughout the rocket progression system and represents the culmination of several Create production chains."
				""
				"Its construction requires mastery of Sequenced Assembly, advanced mechanisms, and large-scale automation."
				""
				"Need help crafting the required components?"
